    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through waves of enemies in the explosive and fast-paced shoot 'em up inspired by the world of Brainrot! Fight your way through to rescue Ballerina Capuchina from the slippered fins of Tralalero Tralala.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/d7eb8367f2fbcd9ca4a848111059b6d3.avif?t=1755097433\" width=700 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling shoot 'em up packed with action and bullet hell chaos\u2014though carefully tuned to keep things fun rather than frustrating. Dive into the 30 intense stages of <strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo MISSION</strong> and take on the challenge. Defeat the three major bosses from the three story zones to finally set Ballerina Capuchina free from the clutches of Tralalero Tralala and his henchmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/1f0d9ca0868bd1ac9e396c30f2dce182.avif?t=1755097433\" width=600 height=108 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bombardiro Crocodilo in this explosive shoot 'em up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, fluid, and frantic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more than 12 playable characters with different characteristics, including Bombardini Cusini Ballerina Capuchin and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills after completing certain levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special power to destroy enemies (super power)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill waves of enemies in over 30 handcrafted stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock skins inspired by the world of Brainrot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skins like Bombardiro Crocodilo, Bombardini Gusini, Ballerina Capuchina, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various types of bullets with unique characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 3 main bosses from the Brainrot universe: Chimpancini Bananini, Tung Tung Shaur, and Tralalero Tralala</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 30 thrilling stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the exotic original soundtrack crafted for your journey as the savior of Ballerina Capuchina</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/8fe2ade676619d7a3b866b8825a8eed2.avif?t=1755097433\" width=700 height=526 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through waves of enemies in the explosive and fast-paced shoot 'em up inspired by the world of Brainrot! Fight your way through to rescue Ballerina Capuchina from the slippered fins of Tralalero Tralala.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/d7eb8367f2fbcd9ca4a848111059b6d3.avif?t=1755097433\" width=700 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling shoot 'em up packed with action and bullet hell chaos\u2014though carefully tuned to keep things fun rather than frustrating. Dive into the 30 intense stages of <strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo MISSION</strong> and take on the challenge. Defeat the three major bosses from the three story zones to finally set Ballerina Capuchina free from the clutches of Tralalero Tralala and his henchmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/1f0d9ca0868bd1ac9e396c30f2dce182.avif?t=1755097433\" width=600 height=108 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bombardiro Crocodilo in this explosive shoot 'em up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, fluid, and frantic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more than 12 playable characters with different characteristics, including Bombardini Cusini Ballerina Capuchin and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills after completing certain levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special power to destroy enemies (super power)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill waves of enemies in over 30 handcrafted stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock skins inspired by the world of Brainrot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skins like Bombardiro Crocodilo, Bombardini Gusini, Ballerina Capuchina, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various types of bullets with unique characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the 3 main bosses from the Brainrot universe: Chimpancini Bananini, Tung Tung Shaur, and Tralalero Tralala</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 30 thrilling stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the exotic original soundtrack crafted for your journey as the savior of Ballerina Capuchina</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/8fe2ade676619d7a3b866b8825a8eed2.avif?t=1755097433\" width=700 height=526 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In this fun and frenetic shooter, you'll play as Bombardiro Crocodilo, who's trying to save Ballerina Capuchina from Tralalero Tralala's shoed fins. Embark on an action-packed journey with tons of shooting, different weapons, and skins from the Brainrot universe!",
